text:
But how is your example UB? It&#x27;s straightforward data flow analysis.<p>AFAICT, UBI is stuff like that:<p><pre><code>  short int i;
  for (i = 0; i &lt; 33000; i++) do_something();
</code></pre>
Whether this program continues as normal, crashes, or enters an infinite loop is platform-dependent, because short int can be as small as 16 bit, and an integer overflow past 32767 can be a crash or a wraparound.
